# The team develops on Windows and CI runs on ubuntu-latest. Without this, the
# bytes of a go:embed'ed .up.sql (or any tracked text file) can differ between
# the two, which breaks any content hash and makes shell scripts copied into
# Linux images unrunnable.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
